#
# carhmi_view - the view of the car HMI demo (sdcard modules).
#
# Its views (carhmi.dmv, the fonts and images it draws) are installed to
# <build>/sdcard/views/carhmi_view/ - on the SD card they are
# <card>/views/carhmi_view/, where carhmi.ini looks for them. See
# docs/dmod-boot.md.
#
carhmi_view
